<h3>Impact</h3>
<ul>
<li>Outbound email delivery delayed for ~35% of corporate traffic routing through gateway-prod-03</li>
<li>gateway-prod-01 and gateway-prod-02 are picking up overflow (current load: 68% and 71% respectively)</li>
<li>If backlog exceeds 60 minutes, automatic failover will trigger (may cause brief duplicate deliveries)</li>
</ul>

<h3>Runbook</h3>
<p>Follow <b>IR-2026-34 §4.2</b> for SMTP queue backlog:</p>
<ol>
<li>Check upstream pool status: <code>curl -s http://gateway-prod-03.corp.internal:9090/metrics | grep smtp_pool</code></li>
<li>If mail-pool-04 is greylisted, remove from pool: <code>smtpctl pool remove mail-pool-04</code></li>
<li>Flush queue gradually (rate-limit to avoid upstream bounce): <code>smtpctl queue flush --rate 500/s</code></li>
<li>Monitor for 15 minutes; if backlog &lt; 10min, mark resolved</li>
</ol>

